            <section>
                <h2>Summary</h2>
                <p>Platform and infrastructure engineer with 4+ years at a smart-home IoT company. Sole engineer responsible for its cloud platform and infrastructure, which supports 10,000+ hubs and about 1 million connected devices. Make the architecture, reliability and cost decisions for the cloud side, and write the protocol and API specs that a core team of about 10 firmware, mobile and backend engineers build against. Took over a manually deployed legacy stack and made it stable, with automated, zero-downtime releases.</p>
