                <h2>Skills</h2>
                <p><strong>Cloud &amp; Infrastructure:</strong> Google Cloud Platform (GCP: Compute Engine, Cloud Run, Cloud SQL, Cloud Storage, IAM, VPC), AWS (EKS), Kubernetes (k8s), Helm, Docker, Docker Compose, Terraform, OpenTofu, Infrastructure as Code (IaC), Proxmox, cloud-init</p>
                <p><strong>CI/CD &amp; Releases:</strong> GitHub Actions, GitOps, blue-green deployments, canary releases, feature flags, automated rollback</p>
                <p><strong>Observability:</strong> Grafana, Loki, Prometheus, VictoriaMetrics, VictoriaLogs, Grafana Alloy, OpenTelemetry, distributed tracing</p>
                <p><strong>Reliability:</strong> Incident response, root cause analysis (RCA), high availability, disaster recovery, performance and JVM tuning, cost optimization (FinOps)</p>
                <p><strong>Linux &amp; Networking:</strong> Linux (Debian, Ubuntu), systemd, Nginx, DNS, TCP/UDP, iptables, nftables, NAT64, rate limiting, DDoS mitigation</p>
                <p><strong>Security:</strong> TLS certificates, Let's Encrypt, mTLS, PKI, IAM, least privilege, zero trust</p>
                <p><strong>Databases &amp; Messaging:</strong> PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis (Pub/Sub), ClickHouse, database administration, query optimization, indexing, data migration</p>
                <p><strong>Languages &amp; Frameworks:</strong> Go, Kotlin, Java, Python, Rust, Bash, SQL, C, Spring Boot, gRPC, Protocol Buffers, REST APIs, microservices</p>
                <p><strong>Practices:</strong> Test-driven development (TDD), Extreme Programming (XP), API and protocol design</p>
